# MAGIC
# MAGIC The Golden Gate Ginger, with its subtle spice and molasses sweetness, was a delightful treat. Tokyo Tidbits, while small, packed a punch with their unique blend of flavors. Lastly, the Pearly Pies, though not a cookie, were a delightful surprise - mini pie masterpieces that left me wanting more.
